Package: serial-debug
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.2),
         libqt6gui6 (>= 6.2),
         libqt6core6 (>= 6.2),
         libqt6serialport6 (>= 6.2),
         libstdc++6 (>= 9),
         libc6 (>= 2.31),
         libgcc-s1 (>= 4.0)
Recommends: qt6-gtk-platformtheme | qt6-qpa-platformtheme
Maintainer: Serial Debug Team <dev@example.com>
Description: Modern cross-platform serial port debug assistant
 A feature-rich serial port debugging tool with modern UI,
 supporting multi-language (Chinese/English), dark/light themes,
 configurable baud rate/data bits/parity/stop bits, hex display,
 timestamp logging, timer send, and log export.
Homepage: https://github.com/ZefengWang/qtSerial